---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../data/site-config';
---

<Layout
    title="Health Checks — Verify Your Ash Linux Stack"
    description="Check that Qdrant, Ollama, LSFS daemon, and the launcher hook are all running correctly."
    ogImage="/og-image.svg"
    ogUrl={`${SITE_CONFIG.siteUrl}/verify`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Health Checks</h1>
        <p class="lead">Verify every component in your Ash Linux stack is running correctly.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="component-table">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Component Health</h2>
        <div class="health-cards">
            <article class="health-card">
                <div class="health-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Qdrant</h3>
                <p>Vector database on <code>:6333</code></p>
                <pre><code>curl -s http://localhost:6333/health</code></pre>
                <span class="health-expected">→ <code>{"ok":true}</code></span>
            </article>
            <article class="health-card">
                <div class="health-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ai)" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Ollama</h3>
                <p>Embedding model on <code>:11434</code></p>
                <pre><code>curl -s http://localhost:11434/api/tags</code></pre>
                <span class="health-expected">→ Must contain <code>nomic-embed-text</code></span>
            </article>
            <article class="health-card">
                <div class="health-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>LSFS Daemon</h3>
                <p>File indexer (user service)</p>
                <pre><code>systemctl --user status lsfs-daemon</code></pre>
                <span class="health-expected">→ <code>Active: active (running)</code></span>
            </article>
            <article class="health-card">
                <div class="health-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 12h6M12 9v6"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Launcher Hook</h3>
                <p>Super+Space script</p>
                <pre><code>test -x ~/.config/scripts/lsfs_launcher_hook.sh</code></pre>
                <span class="health-expected">→ Exit code 0</span>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="e2e">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>End-to-End Test</h2>
        <div class="e2e-card">
            <p>Verify the full pipeline works together:</p>
            <pre><code>  # 1. Query via CLI
  lsfs-query 'my config files'

  # 2. Check Qdrant collection
  curl -s http://localhost:6333/collections | python3 -m json.tool

  # 3. Live daemon logs
  journalctl --user -u lsfs-daemon -f</code></pre>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="fix-all">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Auto-Fix</h2>
        <p>If any check fails, re-run the installer — it's fully idempotent:</p>
        <pre><code>  curl -sfL {SITE_CONFIG.deployUrl} | sudo bash</code></pre>
    </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
.health-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}
.health-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
}
.health-icon { margin-bottom: 12px; }
.health-card h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.health-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.health-card pre {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 12px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.health-card code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; }
.health-expected { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
.health-expected code { background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 40px 0 16px; color: var(--text); }
p { color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.e2e-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
    max-width: 700px;
}
pre {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 14px;
}
pre code { font-family: var(--font-mono); line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
